":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105514","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105514.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105514.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This pull request introduces full tvOS (Apple TV) export platform support for the Godot Engine, compatible with the latest version of tvOS.\r\n\r\nKey implementation goals:\r\n\r\n- Allow developers to export projects to tvOS, with proper input and rendering support.\r\n- Integrate tvOS export presets into the Godot Export UI, using a structure consistent with existing platforms (e.g., iOS).\r\n- Maintain engine cleanliness and stability by minimizing changes to existing code and reusing existing systems (input, rendering, etc.).\r\n\r\n📌 Highlights:\r\n\r\n- 🔧 New platform/tvos/ module to manage tvOS-specific exporting. \r\n- 🎮 Gamepad and Apple TV Remote support using Godot’s input system. \r\n- 🎨 Vulkan and Metal rendering compatibility via existing Godot renderer infrastructure. \r\n- 📤 Export Preset integration for tvOS in the editor. \r\n- 🛠️ SCons build target: platform=tvos. \r\n- ✅ Fully documented changes that follow Godot’s contribution and code formatting guidelines.\r\n\r\nPlease give it a shot and let me know if you run into issues.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jhaleit","id":4206603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDY2MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4206603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhaleit","html_url":"https